{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜直擊海洋公園海洋摩天塔升到最高位發生故障\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-1710-LIVE-OP-261109.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】海洋公園的海洋摩天塔發生故障。</p><p>大約下午三時，消防接報海洋公園的海洋摩天塔升到最高位時懷疑發生故障，大約40人在塔上，而消防到場後，有39人可以自行離開，剩餘一人要由消防帶離現場。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.764538+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.088592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:58.224595+00:00","content_hash":"5af9584a772ca404d107ac6a73803dd144d69e4e8ba002680ec339416dd21c64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.764538+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}